2026-11-18 23:44:08,578 - test - INFO - Existing record: {'id': UUID('01a1ef32-be0b-725c-afdf-e2c448e1c1ba'), 'title': "Magic: The Gathering's Fantasy Universe Heads To Netflix In PLANESWALKER", 'link': 'https://businesstoday.com.my/2026/11/18/magic-the-gatherings-fantasy-universe-heads-to-netflix-in-planeswalker', 'snippet': 'Reach Publishing Sdn Bhd 15-3, Block F1, Jalan PJU 1/42, Dataran Prima, 47301, Petaling Jaya, Selangor\nMagic: The Gathering is making the move from tabletop to television, with Netflix set to release PLANESWALKER, an animated series based on the long-running fantasy card game, in 2027.', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 11, 18, 9, 7, 22, 481288, tzinfo=zoneinfo.ZoneInfo(key='Etc/UTC')), 'source': 'businesstoday.com.my', 'article_language': None, 'article_type': 'news', 'content': 'Magic: The Gathering is making the move from tabletop to television, with Netflix set to release PLANESWALKER, an animated series based on the long-running fantasy card game, in 2027.\nDeveloped with Hasbro Entertainment and Wizards of the Coast, the series will draw on more than 30 years of Magic: The Gathering lore, focusing on the powerful mages known as Planeswalkers and the conflicts between them.\nThe story centres on Chandra, a pyromancer hunted for her abilities and troubled by her past. When a new threat emerges, she joins forces with other well-known Planeswalkers to prevent a war that could destroy multiple worlds. The story will also explore the alliances and personal conflicts that shape their fight.\nTerry Matalas, whose previous credits include Star Trek: Picard and VisionQuest, leads the series as showrunner alongside co-showrunner and writer Cindy Appel. Patrick Osborne, the Oscar-winning director of animated short Feast, serves as supervising director and executive producer.\nAdapting the franchise presents a considerable amount of source material. Magic: The Gathering has built an extensive fictional universe through thousands of cards, each featuring characters, settings and storylines. Appel has highlighted the scale of the existing world, while Matalas noted that individual cards offer starting points for developing its broader mythology.\nThe animation is being produced by DIGIC Pictures, with Daisy May West serving as producer. The executive production team also includes Gabriel Marano, while Lauren Chavez-Myers is co-executive producer for Hasbro Entertainment.\nPLANESWALKER will be the latest screen adaptation of a major gaming franchise, bringing Magic: The Gathering’s characters and established mythology to a wider audience. The series is scheduled to premiere on Netflix in 2027, with a first-look video already released ahead of its debut.', 'content_status': 'completed', 'content_error': None, 'embedding': '[-0.01907616,0.0008851577,-0.021009283,-0.010552291,0.0059266286,-0.021603825,-0.027787834,-0.038433325,-0.0067064846,0.027263032,0.0057242797,0.024657734,-0.023087367,-0.027453795,-0.01180226,0.031184193,0.0023983743,-0.028071005,0.04046906,-0.016875621,-0.0069841943,-0.05818088,0.015537513,0.015375031,0.021343878,0.0022425763,0.02904608,-0.015254526,-0.015496396,-0.027543696,-0.023503715,0.0014552003,-0.011122788,-0.0016726448,0.007846124,-0.06225848,-0.0007232245,0.017034026,-0.02675947,0.017013753,-0.016255632,0.022683693,0.009840209,-0.019145219,-0.003176433,-0.055392396,-0.008349641,-0.012209887,0.015836334,0.005201244,-0.013150921,0.0148507375,0.030936837,0.026011826,0.015092832,0.018830677,-0.023242839,-0.01009115,-0.008220679,-0.0005447088,0.01895264,0.0172283,0.01561888,-0.03178209,0.011984554,0.07869544,0.039987642,0.029628115,0.0038161324,-0.014284992,-0.04016788,0.08429631,0.02520758,-0.021117162,-0.051982984,0.011281933,0.009470297,-0.037950497,0.0638872,-0.0026627185,0.0071787057,-0.011316536,-0.020481389,0.0014696808,-0.032015614,-0.0048460453,-0.06481004,0.041662216,0.03584356,0.041365772,0.016830422,-0.031859417,0.029200578,-0.010986852,-0.04121567,-0.0030068536,-0.03133